@base = http://localhost:8083
@customerToken = paste-customer-accessToken-here
@adminToken = paste-admin-accessToken-here
@agentToken = paste-agent-accessToken-here
@ticketId = 1
@agentId = 2
@resetToken = paste-token-from-Mailpit-here

### Register a customer
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Student One","email":"customer@example.test","password":"Customer123!"}

### Login as customer; copy accessToken into customerToken
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"customer@example.test","password":"Customer123!"}

### View current user
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Create ticket; copy response id into ticketId
POST {{base}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Cannot log in","description":"I cannot sign in after changing my email.","priority":"HIGH","category":"ACCOUNT"}

### Edit ticket while OPEN
PUT {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Cannot log in","description":"Login fails on both phone and laptop.","priority":"HIGH","category":"ACCOUNT"}

### Search own tickets; remove filters to see all visible tickets
GET {{base}}/api/tickets?q=login&status=OPEN&priority=HIGH&category=ACCOUNT&page=0&size=10&sortBy=createdAt&direction=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Login as demo admin; use your configured password, copy accessToken
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@example.test","password":"AdminDemo123!"}

### List agents; copy desired id into agentId
GET {{base}}/api/admin/agents
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin assigns the ticket
PATCH {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/assignment
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"agentId":{{agentId}}}

### Login as demo agent; use your configured password, copy accessToken
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"agent@example.test","password":"AgentDemo123!"}

### View assigned tickets
GET {{base}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### Agent starts work
PATCH {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"IN_PROGRESS"}

### Agent adds comment
POST {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Investigating the email change now."}

### Agent resolves ticket
PATCH {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"RESOLVED"}

### Customer closes resolved ticket
PATCH {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"CLOSED"}

### View ticket
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### View comments
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### View status/assignment history
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Admin tracks progress by status
GET {{base}}/api/tickets?status=CLOSED&page=0&size=10&sortBy=updatedAt&direction=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Forgot password; open http://localhost:8025 to read reset email
POST {{base}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"customer@example.test"}

### Reset password; update the login request after this
POST {{base}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"{{resetToken}}","password":"Changed123!"}
